 "summary": "A 3 mm round through-hole indicator lamp with an AlGaInP chip emitting brilliant red (624 nm dominant) through a red diffused epoxy lens. At 20 mA it gives 80 mcd typical over a 45 degree viewing angle with a 2.0 V typical forward drop. Leads are on a 2.54 mm pitch, the anode being the longer one; it is offered on tape and reel. Lead free, RoHS and REACH compliant and halogen free, with bromine and chlorine each under 900 ppm and their sum under 1500 ppm; named uses are TV sets, monitors, telephones and computers.",
